&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;② 人的資本&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;[人材育成の方針]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:35.2pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:424.7pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:141.6pt;min-width:141.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:141.6pt;min-width:141.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:141.6pt;min-width:141.6pt;"/&gt;
